// The type library as a resource of the server.
//
// `RT_TYPELIB` is 7, and a component that registers itself expects its own
// type library to be there under id 1 -- that is the resource
// `LoadTypeLibEx(module_path)` reads. Building it into the image is what makes
// "parse the type library out of the archive" the same operation as "parse the
// type library of a normal server".
//
// The type is spelled `7` and not `TYPELIB` on purpose: RC has no `TYPELIB`
// keyword, so the word would become the *name* of a user-defined type, and
// `FindResource(h, MAKEINTRESOURCE(7), ...)` would not find it -- nor would
// `LoadTypeLibEx`, which is the whole point of the resource.

#pragma code_page(1252)

1 7 "com_server.tlb"
